      en: ["It holds the original manuscripts of Rizal's novels.", "The building was constructed in the 1960s.", "It serves as the legal depository for all materials published in the Philippines.", "The Filipiniana Division contains rare books and manuscripts about the Philippines.", "Provides free access to its collections for the public.", "It has a Braille and multimedia section.", "The building overlooks Rizal Park."],
