      en: ["Originally constructed in 1750 as a summer villa for Luis Rocha.", "The government purchased the property in 1825 for 1,100 pesos.", "Became the official residence in 1863 following a major earthquake.", "Located in the San Miguel district along the banks of the Pasig River.", "Kalayaan Hall serves as the oldest remaining portion of the structure.", "The museum contains artifacts from all 17 Philippine presidents."],
